    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Israeli geesawan aba Misri",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Suh gheawunga orjooga Israeli gil ghayi weay Misri nea goodeayi Yakobo, nea gaba siisi adeayi fugeaba gheanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rubeni, ea Simeoni, ea Lawi, ea Yuda, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isakari, ea Sabuloni, ea Benjamini, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ea Dani ea Naftali, Gadi ea Asheri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Fuga sean sijiilsa gheeh Yakobo, ea laadam ea damanamughuush; abeeda Yosefu nigeawiit goobiida Misri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.1.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iimuchu ghami Yosefu, sea orjooga ghaamwat sean, sea seaygeedida seaniin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea fuga Israeli iissa ghoahaada ea ghwasaang'ayiit muuchi; ak ghwadarda nea ghwanyas uurda; ak geeyi bwak ea gwadukuta saawa ng'eanyiida.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.1.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iimuchu ghoang'waay sugoocheanduumeeda ng'eanyiida Misri, sugoocheanda nuut mwanala Yosefu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwayeesha fugaaschi, “Ang'ula, fuga Israeli nisaang'ayiit muuchi, ea gaburdeaweesa uurda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eaniyean eesina fughareeda adaghoahaada fiisu, ama buseasa ng'ucheeda, ea maweayi meatkweeda weajoodigaasa ak geeng'ucheewi saawa ak gamng'aw aba ng'eang'i.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.1.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata geegeanu fuga jea gamineadaysa saawa ak ghwanung' gwasin gadiyeeda hang'waay jea gwasawan; ak gwadeeksa Farao ghoorajeega mujiini was Bitomu ea Ramesesi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Earapeadi sisawaniin, ghoahaada muuchi nea gwadarsa ng'eanyiisean. Ak ghang'ut muuwda fuga Misri aba badayda fuga Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean geanung' gwasin fuga Israeli gadiyeeda hang'waay muuchi bwada sawanadeeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghwanung' ghang'waaniit giibinda nyaawa aba gadiyeeda hang'waay, bea roonghooda ea mwatafwaari, ea gilinyo ea gadiyeeda gil bea jeeda madamnyeanda; nea aba gadiyoojiga nyaawa sean iissa geanung' gwasin nea geesawan.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.1.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwalamda sugoocheanda Misri ak gwayeesha deepshoodiga gadeemga Ebraniya, nea akaleala geeguura gheawungaaschi Shifra nea niirja geeguura Bua, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.1.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Iyoogadiiyi nea goowooschi deepshoodiga gadeemga Ebraniya, ak ghoadaayi gideaba gaygwaji, ii orjeeda gil, abeeda goonuuschi; ak ii huda gil abeeda ghoanung'waadi adoonuuschi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.1.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.1.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 1:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghoawal deepshoodiga gheang'da ASEETA, ak ea mutgwasinda gidarukusiinda sugoocheanda Misri saawa, ak ea meenuusa diibiga was orjooga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.1.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 1:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gaguursa sugoocheanda Misri deepshoodiga ak gwayeesha saawa, “Ghwasaan anda goosinyi ng'asheanji, ak ghoanung'waadi diibiga was orjooga nea moonuuseadani?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.1.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.1.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 1:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.1.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.1.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 1:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwalamda deepshoodiga ak gwayeesha Farao, “Nih gwasin gadeemga fuga Ebraniya mawuurji gadeemga Misri; saawa jeata nyaawa iissa ea asas iissa gabay gwaji nea miighwahita heeda deepshoocheanda.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.1.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.1.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 1:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwasissa ASEETA deepshoodigiga ng'asheega miyaas; ak ghoahaada buuneeda nea gwandeawa uurda muuchi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.1.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.1.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 1:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean nea ghoawal deepshoodiga gheang'da ASEETA iidu ghoadaw ASEETA jeata. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.1.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.1.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 1:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwayeesha Farao fugaaschi sean, “Gilinyoo ea orjeeda gil, siji bea fuga Ebraniya ajaksiina jeedeenda Nayli, nea diibiga was haweega ghoanung'waadi adoonuuschi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.1.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.1.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
